# Anything the image builds for itself, or must never end up inside it.
#
# One rule here is load-bearing: skills/ must NOT be excluded. The docs page
# reads skills/*/SKILL.md from disk at runtime, so a blanket *.md exclusion
# (which this file used to have) ships an image whose docs section is silently
# empty.
node_modules
.next
.git
.env
.env*.local
npm-debug.log*
.claude
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
README.md
site
docker-compose.yml
docker
